#type:     node
#context:  top
#internal: deadlinecloudscheduler

= Deadline Cloud Scheduler (Experimental) =

"""The PDG scheduler for AWS Deadline Cloud. Experimental: not functional in this build."""

WARNING:
    This node is experimental and is not functional in this build. Starting a
    cook with it fails. Do not use it in production scenes.

== Overview ==

This scheduler cooks a TOP network as one AWS Deadline Cloud job. Each
schedulable TOP node becomes a step, and each work item becomes a task.

The integration is under active development. Its behavior, parameters, and the
graphs it supports will change before release.
